sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend Client
    participant API as Flask Backend
    participant Agent as Vegapunk Agent
    participant Extractor as Entity Extractor
    participant Mem as Memory (Vector + SQL)
    participant Graph as Graph Store (NetworkX)
    participant Fusion as Fusion Layer
    participant LLM as Gemini Models (1 & 2)

    User->>FE: Inputs Message (Text/Image)
    FE->>API: HTTP POST /api/chat

    note right of API: Request Handling
    API->>Agent: Process Chat Request
    Agent->>Mem: Retrieve Session History (Last N Messages)
    Mem-->>Agent: History Array

    note right of Agent: Intent Classification
    Agent->>LLM: Classify Query (API Key 2)
    LLM-->>Agent: Query Type (Simple/Complex/Tool)

    alt Complex Query / Tool Use
        Agent->>Extractor: Extract Entities from User Input (API Key 3)
        Extractor-->>Agent: Entity List (People, Places, Concepts)
        
        par Parallel Retrieval
            Agent->>Mem: Perform Vector Search (Cosine Sim)
            Agent->>Graph: Query Graph Neighbors (1 Hop)
        end
        
        Mem-->>Agent: Semantic Matches
        Graph-->>Agent: Structural Matches

        Agent->>Fusion: Rank & Fuse Context
        note right of Fusion: Score = (α*Semantic) + (β*Structural) + (γ*Recency)
        Fusion-->>Agent: Top-K Ranked Context Chunks
    end

    Agent->>LLM: Generate Final Response (API Key 1)
    LLM-->>Agent: Final Text Reply

    par Post-Processing (Async)
        Agent->>Extractor: Extract Entities from Model Reply (API Key 4)
        Extractor->>Graph: Update Knowledge Graph (New Nodes/Edges)
        Agent->>Mem: Save Conversation to History
    end

    Agent-->>API: JSON Response {reply, sources}
    API-->>FE: HTTP 200 OK
    FE-->>User: Display Response
